### single quoted word against a quoted number
[[ 'total' -eq "3" ]] && echo "three"
>>> SC2154 1:4
>>> SC2309 1:4

### unassigned bare word against a number
[[ retries -eq 3 ]] && echo "three"
>>> SC2154 1:4
>>> SC2309 1:4

### lone slash against a number
[[ 4 -eq / ]] && echo "odd"
>>> SC2309 1:10

### unassigned bare word against itself
[[ attempts -eq attempts ]] && echo "same"
>>> SC2154 1:4
>>> SC2309 1:17
>>> SC2309 1:4

### bare word assigned earlier is fine
retries=0
[[ retries -eq 3 ]] && echo "three"
>>> none
